{"id":"08beb75865b66edb","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-rectangle.md","title":"Rectangle in Product","display":"df-rectangle — Rectangle in Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-rectangle","aliases":["58-df-rectangle"],"display":"df-rectangle — Rectangle in Product","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-rectangle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-rectangle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rectangle — Rectangle in Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A,B,X,Y\\in V\\land A\\subseteq X\\land B\\subseteq Y\">\\(R,A,B,X,Y\\in V\\land A\\subseteq X\\land B\\subseteq Y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V\">\\((-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\\in V\">\\(A\\times B\\in V\\)</span> (Cartesian product, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rect}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{RectangleIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rect}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{RectangleIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rectangle\\text{-}factors} \\vdash \\operatorname{Rect}(R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow R=A\\times B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rectangle\\text{-}factors} \\vdash \\operatorname{Rect}(R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow R=A\\times B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rectangle\\text{-}ambient} \\vdash \\operatorname{RectangleIn}_S(R,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;(R=A\\times B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rectangle\\text{-}ambient} \\vdash \\operatorname{RectangleIn}_S(R,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;(R=A\\times B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a, b \\rangle\">\\(\\langle a, b \\rangle\\)</span> denotes the ordered pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a, b)\">\\((a, b)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In cardinal arithmetic, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A\\times B|=|A|\\cdot|B|\">\\(|A\\times B|=|A|\\cdot|B|\\)</span> for arbitrary sets; for finite sets this agrees with ordinary multiplication.</li>\n<li><code>Rect</code> records specified factors, whereas <code>RectangleIn_S</code> existentially binds factors constrained by the two displayed ambient carriers; these are intentionally different three-place predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V$ and $A\\times B\\in V$ (Cartesian product, see [[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A,B,X,Y\\in V\\land A\\subseteq X\\land B\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"(-)\\times(-):V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rect}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{RectangleIn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rectangle\\text{-}factors} \\vdash \\operatorname{Rect}(R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow R=A\\times B","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rectangle\\text{-}ambient} \\vdash \\operatorname{RectangleIn}_S(R,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;(R=A\\times B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle a, b \\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(a, b)","display":false},{"tex":"|A\\times B|=|A|\\cdot|B|","display":false}],"bytes":1271,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1051","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-rectangle.md|58-df-rectangle]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["445e1cd0bb5274eb"]}